1
00:01:42,320 --> 00:01:44,000
Your uncle is still waiting for me.

2
00:01:44,120 --> 00:01:45,360
Who knows

3
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:47,000
who will run the household in the future?

4
00:01:51,280 --> 00:01:52,640
Mom told me long ago

5
00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:55,120
to be vigilant on the people around me.

6
00:01:55,440 --> 00:01:56,280
Lu Yuanyuan,

7
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:57,880
you are

8
00:01:57,920 --> 00:01:59,160
not even worth a dog.

9
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:00,800
And you claim to treat me best?

10
00:02:01,440 --> 00:02:02,600
I'm no fool.

11
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:04,560
It's utterly ridiculous.

12
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:18,840
Mr. He is waiting for you in the underground monitoring room.

13
00:02:19,080 --> 00:02:19,960
I'll take you down.

14
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:20,960
Monitoring room?

15
00:02:21,880 --> 00:02:24,320
Mom always forbids me from going downstairs.

16
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:35,200
Song Ke.

17
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:36,160
Get me the coach.

18
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:38,440
I need combat training.

19
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:40,440
M-M-Mr. Xiaoquan.

20
00:02:40,920 --> 00:02:43,640
Today, it's Mu Yi, the Sanda champion, running the session.

21
00:02:43,880 --> 00:02:45,840
H-He never holds back.

22
00:02:45,920 --> 00:02:47,000
Mu Yi?

23
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:48,240
That's perfect.

24
00:02:48,440 --> 00:02:49,880
Alright, Song Ke, go get him.

25
00:02:50,200 --> 00:02:50,640
G...

26
00:02:50,680 --> 00:02:51,480
G-Got it.

27
00:03:20,920 --> 00:03:21,800
To defeat an enemy,

28
00:03:21,920 --> 00:03:23,320
it's not about relentless attack,

29
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:24,920
but calm observation,

30
00:03:25,440 --> 00:03:26,880
finding their weakness.

31
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:30,960
I'm just impatient,

32
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:32,320
wanting to master it quickly.

33
00:03:32,480 --> 00:03:33,120
To use my fists

34
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:34,640
and deliver a fatal blow to the villains.

35
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:35,680
Our enemies

36
00:03:35,760 --> 00:03:37,200
are hidden evildoers,

37
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:39,120
not the kind you can see with punches and kicks.

38
00:03:40,200 --> 00:03:40,800
Zizhou.

39
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:42,440
Stellarport is full of violence.

40
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:44,280
To protect my family,

41
00:03:44,440 --> 00:03:45,480
I need to keep training.

42
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:46,680
Again.

43
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:48,480
Come on, continue.

44
00:03:49,640 --> 00:03:50,440
Xiaoquan.

45
00:03:50,760 --> 00:03:51,760
You've been at it for hours.

46
00:03:52,200 --> 00:03:53,080
Overloading yourself

47
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:54,520
will only backfire.

48
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:55,120
No.

49
00:03:55,480 --> 00:03:56,320
I need to fight.

50
00:03:56,440 --> 00:03:56,880
Come on.

51
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,400
You've grown,

52
00:03:59,480 --> 00:04:00,480
why are you still so willful?

53
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:01,640
Cao Fei,

54
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,000
you spar with him.

55
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:03,720
Okay.

56
00:04:18,440 --> 00:04:19,680
M-M-Mr. Xiaoquan.

57
00:04:22,400 --> 00:04:22,960
You...

58
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:23,800
Xiaoquan.

59
00:04:54,320 --> 00:04:55,160
Still messing around?

60
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:57,520
You train well,

61
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:58,800
but you're not stealthy enough,

62
00:04:59,000 --> 00:04:59,800
easy to expose.

63
00:05:00,560 --> 00:05:01,840
Come upstairs with me to shower.

64
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:23,200
Dad!

65
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:24,600
Dad!

66
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:27,680
Xiaoquan got beaten up in an alley today.

67
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:28,720
When I grow up,

68
00:05:29,080 --> 00:05:30,600
I will definitely protect him.

69
00:05:30,640 --> 00:05:33,200
I won't let the bad guys bully him.

70
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:50,720
Let's go.

71
00:06:25,760 --> 00:06:26,280
Zizhou.

72
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:28,560
I heard you coughing earlier.

73
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:31,720
Xiaoquan.

74
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:33,240
Right now,

75
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:35,160
we all need to be careful about our own safety.

76
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:39,920
Lily is my ally from Xinzelan City abroad.

77
00:06:40,440 --> 00:06:42,560
She looks so much like Xiaoxiao,

78
00:06:43,440 --> 00:06:43,920
that's why

79
00:06:44,160 --> 00:06:45,600
she caught my attention.

80
00:06:46,840 --> 00:06:48,920
You and Yu Jinning used DNA testing

81
00:06:49,440 --> 00:06:50,880
to confirm their identities as sisters?

82
00:06:50,960 --> 00:06:51,760
Yes.

83
00:06:52,320 --> 00:06:54,880
To investigate the cases involving our parents and Xiaoxiao,

84
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:57,160
though we disguised Lily

85
00:06:57,440 --> 00:06:58,200
as Xiaoxiao,

86
00:06:58,400 --> 00:07:00,240
putting her into this life-or-death game,

87
00:07:00,840 --> 00:07:02,880
we cannot let her face any danger.

88
00:07:04,280 --> 00:07:05,400
I will protect her

89
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:06,680
and our home.

90
00:07:07,520 --> 00:07:08,320
Hmm.

91
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:12,320
Behind He Huan isn't just Lu Gao,

92
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:14,320
but also mysterious tycoons from Guangcheng.

93
00:07:14,720 --> 00:07:16,320
Their power is deep and unfathomable.

94
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:19,080
They control the entire Zhengyan Group,

95
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:21,040
extending their reach through commerce

96
00:07:21,320 --> 00:07:22,640
across domestic and international markets.

97
00:07:23,400 --> 00:07:24,160
Remember,

98
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:25,840
do not act rashly.

99
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:29,800
Xiaoxiao is still in a coma in the ICU.

100
00:07:30,200 --> 00:07:31,280
Who knows when she'll wake?

101
00:07:34,640 --> 00:07:35,840
You're under much more stress now.

102
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:38,000
I would rather

103
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:39,560
see you alive.

104
00:07:40,360 --> 00:07:41,240
Don't ever leave me.

105
00:08:08,080 --> 00:08:08,560
Zizhou.

106
00:08:09,760 --> 00:08:11,400
The training you received abroad

107
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:13,200
was inhuman.

108
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:17,200
To conceal your special identity,

109
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:18,560
now

110
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:21,560
you can't even reveal yourself to Dad.

111
00:08:22,640 --> 00:08:24,840
That must be really hard for you.

112
00:08:45,280 --> 00:08:46,400
In Stellarport,

113
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:49,040
to fight the dark forces,

114
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:51,320
we must have a just cause.

115
00:08:52,920 --> 00:08:54,520
The tragedy of our parents and Xiaoxiao

116
00:08:55,080 --> 00:08:55,800
reminded me

117
00:08:56,760 --> 00:08:59,000
that justice must transcend personal revenge.

118
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:02,040
It can't just be an obsession with vengeance.

119
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:04,040
Only by exposing He Huan

120
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:06,240
and the mysterious figure behind her,

121
00:09:06,800 --> 00:09:08,400
and bringing them to justice,

122
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:10,600
can the people here

123
00:09:11,160 --> 00:09:12,760
truly find peace.

124
00:09:14,520 --> 00:09:14,960
Zizhou.

125
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:17,480
I need to become stronger.

126
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:19,560
Not only to prevent our family

127
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:21,120
from suffering such harm again,

128
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:22,560
but also to restore Chinatown

129
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:24,160
to its former prosperity.

130
00:09:24,520 --> 00:09:26,520
We must take back the property rights seized by Zhengyan Group

131
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:28,200
and return them to the Chinese in Oyster Bay.

132
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:30,480
That's our roots.

133
00:09:33,480 --> 00:09:34,280
Okay.

134
00:10:03,640 --> 00:10:05,960
Those who hurt me

135
00:10:06,560 --> 00:10:08,360
must all die!

136
00:10:09,240 --> 00:10:10,800
They all must die!

137
00:10:13,280 --> 00:10:14,080
Die!

138
00:10:14,560 --> 00:10:15,400
Die!

139
00:10:15,560 --> 00:10:17,440
Don't kill me, Yan Xiaoxiao!

140
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:18,960
You shouldn't have stood in my way.

141
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:21,880
They all must die!

142
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:26,240
Dad!

143
00:10:26,320 --> 00:10:27,080
Die!

144
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:28,320
Where are you?

145
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:28,960
Die!

146
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:29,760
Dad!

147
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:35,000
Dad, it hurts!

148
00:10:35,880 --> 00:10:37,680
Liluo, hang in there.

149
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:39,120
We're at the hospital now.

150
00:10:39,280 --> 00:10:39,960
Hold on.

151
00:10:40,680 --> 00:10:41,480
Nurse!

152
00:10:41,760 --> 00:10:42,240
Nurse!

153
00:10:49,520 --> 00:10:50,520
Dad!

154
00:10:51,840 --> 00:10:53,160
It hurts!

155
00:10:53,920 --> 00:10:55,480
Where are you?

156
00:11:04,680 --> 00:11:06,960
Mom.

157
00:11:07,120 --> 00:11:08,560
Yan Xiaoxiao is coming to kill me again.

158
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:09,400
Liluo?

159
00:11:10,520 --> 00:11:13,000
Isn't she in Taibaoer Hospital?

160
00:11:14,040 --> 00:11:16,840
Don't be afraid. I am coming right away.

161
00:11:25,760 --> 00:11:27,600
The pajamas for you are ready.

162
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:32,760
Liluo.

163
00:11:33,520 --> 00:11:34,440
What's wrong?

164
00:11:36,480 --> 00:11:37,200
Mom,

165
00:11:38,200 --> 00:11:40,000
ever since Yan Xiaoxiao jumped,

166
00:11:40,760 --> 00:11:42,480
I've been feeling uneasy.

167
00:11:42,800 --> 00:11:44,160
I have nightmares every night.

168
00:11:44,480 --> 00:11:45,560
Be good, don't be scared.

169
00:11:45,680 --> 00:11:46,480
It's okay.

170
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:48,760
I will have Uncle send people to watch over you

171
00:11:48,800 --> 00:11:49,600
and protect you.

172
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:52,840
You are my daughter,

173
00:11:52,960 --> 00:11:55,360
the heiress to Zhengyan Group.

174
00:11:56,240 --> 00:11:58,680
You cannot let this affect your focus.

175
00:11:59,640 --> 00:12:00,440
But...

176
00:12:00,840 --> 00:12:03,520
Mom, I'm too scared

177
00:12:04,640 --> 00:12:06,320
to sleep by myself.

178
00:12:08,160 --> 00:12:09,600
Our medical company, Egtver Genome,

179
00:12:09,680 --> 00:12:11,880
has recently developed a new tonic injection.

180
00:12:12,080 --> 00:12:14,320
In a couple of days, once the effects stabilize,

181
00:12:14,440 --> 00:12:15,240
I'll give it to you.

182
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:21,080
When I was your age,

183
00:12:22,160 --> 00:12:24,640
I went through things far worse than what you're experiencing.

184
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:26,640
Remember,

185
00:12:28,440 --> 00:12:30,680
you have to be tougher than everyone else

186
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:34,200
to survive in this devouring Stellarport.

187
00:12:34,960 --> 00:12:36,440
After Yan Xiaoxiao jumped,

188
00:12:36,840 --> 00:12:38,680
my competitor for the National Film Academy

189
00:12:38,720 --> 00:12:39,880
disappeared.

190
00:12:40,160 --> 00:12:40,960
Yes.

191
00:12:41,800 --> 00:12:42,640
In just a few months,

192
00:12:42,680 --> 00:12:44,040
you'll leave Stellarport

193
00:12:44,400 --> 00:12:46,920
and attend your favorite college in Guangcheng.

194
00:12:47,720 --> 00:12:49,240
With Uncle Kang in Guangcheng,

195
00:12:50,040 --> 00:12:51,240
your future path

196
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:53,800
will be bright.

197
00:12:54,640 --> 00:12:55,640
Uncle Kang?

198
00:12:56,760 --> 00:12:57,880
Who is he?

199
00:12:59,520 --> 00:13:01,040
He's someone who will protect you.

200
00:13:03,960 --> 00:13:05,360
After you get up, have some breakfast,

201
00:13:05,400 --> 00:13:07,000
and then head to Jeton Art Center.

202
00:13:07,280 --> 00:13:08,120
Don't overthink things.

203
00:13:08,520 --> 00:13:10,680
You are the sole successor to Zhengyan Group.

204
00:13:11,680 --> 00:13:14,080
Now you hold billions in personal wealth and equity shares.

205
00:13:14,920 --> 00:13:17,520
Uncle and I will never let anyone influence you.

206
00:13:18,040 --> 00:13:21,040
And no one in Stellarport would dare to harm you.

207
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:23,520
Thanks, Mom.

208
00:13:25,600 --> 00:13:27,800
But that Jin Junyi is still missing.

209
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:29,800
As for Yan Xiaoxiao's fall,

210
00:13:30,320 --> 00:13:31,440
it won't implicate me, will it?

211
00:13:31,520 --> 00:13:32,440
Absolutely not.

212
00:13:33,040 --> 00:13:34,560
You didn't push her down the building yourself.

213
00:13:34,640 --> 00:13:37,440
Those who harmed her volunteered to clear the obstacles for you.

214
00:13:37,920 --> 00:13:39,120
You have to believe me.

215
00:13:43,440 --> 00:13:43,920
Mom.

216
00:13:44,760 --> 00:13:46,840
Why hasn't Dad returned to Stellarport yet?

217
00:13:48,400 --> 00:13:50,440
It's been years since I last saw him.

218
00:13:50,960 --> 00:13:53,880
What are you hiding? Out with it!

219
00:13:56,320 --> 00:13:57,400
I'm already

220
00:13:58,080 --> 00:14:00,600
a useless puppet at your mercy.

221
00:14:01,320 --> 00:14:03,320
What could I possibly hide?

222
00:14:03,560 --> 00:14:05,200
The entire Zhengyan Group

223
00:14:05,240 --> 00:14:08,840
has already been swallowed up by you lot.

224
00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:12,160
What do I still

225
00:14:13,320 --> 00:14:14,520
have?

226
00:14:15,040 --> 00:14:16,720
Why say such harsh words?

227
00:14:17,680 --> 00:14:18,720
Xie Zhengyan.

228
00:14:19,040 --> 00:14:20,120
Don't you forget,

229
00:14:20,440 --> 00:14:21,600
back when you and those two fools

230
00:14:21,640 --> 00:14:23,560
came to Stellarport to make your fortune,

231
00:14:23,760 --> 00:14:26,440
how much did I drink for Zhengyan Construction?

232
00:14:26,640 --> 00:14:28,360
How much did others take advantage of me?

233
00:14:28,840 --> 00:14:30,200
Without me,

234
00:14:30,280 --> 00:14:32,280
could the company have grown to its current scale in fifteen years?

235
00:14:32,440 --> 00:14:34,200
I've worked so hard to help you.

236
00:14:34,240 --> 00:14:35,000
And Liluo has grown up now.

237
00:14:35,040 --> 00:14:36,360
What more could you possibly want?

238
00:14:36,400 --> 00:14:37,280
What?

239
00:14:37,520 --> 00:14:38,920
You ruthless woman!

240
00:14:39,640 --> 00:14:40,560
That year,

241
00:14:41,160 --> 00:14:44,880
I asked you with He Zhengnian to Shazhou to save Huo Jia.

242
00:14:45,320 --> 00:14:46,760
What did you do?

243
00:14:47,080 --> 00:14:50,000
You strangled her!

244
00:14:50,400 --> 00:14:53,360
Huo Jia wasn't crushed by a collapsing wall.

245
00:14:53,680 --> 00:14:55,520
You deceived me!

246
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:56,560
And

247
00:14:56,720 --> 00:15:01,480
were Zong Hai and Du Juan also killed by you back then?

248
00:15:02,560 --> 00:15:03,840
What?

249
00:15:04,600 --> 00:15:05,760
Do you have any evidence?

250
00:15:06,360 --> 00:15:07,760
I strangled Huo Jia?

251
00:15:07,840 --> 00:15:08,520
Why?

252
00:15:08,800 --> 00:15:10,280
Huo Jia was your ex-wife.

253
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:12,280
Who have I been all these years?

254
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:15,480
In your heart, I am just a secretary.

255
00:15:15,560 --> 00:15:17,200
Even if I killed her and those two fools,

256
00:15:17,240 --> 00:15:18,240
so what?

257
00:15:18,400 --> 00:15:19,920
It was your signature

258
00:15:19,960 --> 00:15:21,120
that seized their equity shares,

259
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:22,480
took back their houses

260
00:15:22,560 --> 00:15:24,120
and drove them out of Stellarport!

261
00:15:24,680 --> 00:15:26,120
What does that have to do with me?

262
00:15:27,200 --> 00:15:29,600
Zong Hai and Du Juan were such good people.

263
00:15:30,200 --> 00:15:31,880
How could you kill them?

264
00:15:32,360 --> 00:15:34,760
You ruthless woman!

265
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:36,720
You'll end up in tragedy.
